        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          The application workflow involves four structured phases:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Business Plan Submission:</strong> Submit a 10-page pitch deck and 1-year financial model to the Fukuoka City Global Startup Center (English accepted).</li>
          <li><strong>Municipal Examination:</strong> Face-to-face or video interview with Fukuoka City trade examiners to verify tech viability and local ecosystem impact.</li>
          <li><strong>Confirmation Letter (Kashitsu):</strong> Fukuoka City issues the official recommendation certificate within 2 to 3 weeks.</li>
          <li><strong>Immigration Bureau Clearance:</strong> Exchange confirmation certificate at the Fukuoka Regional Immigration Services Bureau for the 6-month residence card (Zairyu Card).</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div>
