        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Network reliability in Fukuoka matches the highest global tier. The urban core is saturated with FTTH (Fiber To The Home) backbones primarily provided by NTT West (FLET'S Hikari Next) and Sony Network Communications (NURO Hikari). Most coliving spaces and dedicated creator studios run dual-redundant fiber drops configured with IPoE (IPv6 over Ethernet) to completely bypass congested PPPoE network gateways during peak evening hours (20:00–23:00 JST).
        </p>

