        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Remote professionals in Fukuoka cluster across three central neighborhoods: **Tenjin** (the commercial center), **Daimyo** (the creative, cafe, and boutique district), and **Hakata** (the Shinkansen rail terminal and corporate district).
