          </li>
          <li class="bg-slate-900/50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
            <strong class="text-white text-base">The Company (Canal City & Daimyo):</strong> A premium multi-location coworking facility equipped with soundproof podcast booths, 1 Gbps fiber drops, dedicated desks, and private lockable creator studios starting at ¥45,000/month (~$300 USD).
          </li>
          <li class="bg-slate-900/50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
            <strong class="text-white text-base">HafH Fukuoka THE LIFE (Gion):</strong> A boutique coliving hostel hybrid catering directly to international digital nomads, offering monthly residency packages, communal workspaces, specialty pour-over coffee, and high-speed mesh Wi-Fi.
          </li>
        </ul>
